<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#130c24">
  <meta name="description" content="Kaboot is a locally hosted quiz engine that brings a big-screen experience, phone buzzers and strategic scoring to your quiz night.">
  <title>Kaboot — Make every point a moment</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="container header-inner">
      <a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="Kaboot home">
        <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">K</span>
        <span>kaboot<span class="brand-dot">.</span></span>
      </a>
      <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="#how-it-works">How it works</a>
        <a href="#game-modes">Game modes</a>
        <a href="#scoring">Scoring</a>
      </nav>
      <a class="header-link" href="#the-setup">The setup <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="top">
    <section class="hero container">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span> A QUIZ NIGHT, TURNED UP</p>
        <h1>Make every point <span>a moment.</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-description">The big screen sets the scene. Phones become buzzers. And every answer can change the leaderboard.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button button-primary" href="#how-it-works">See how it works <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <a class="text-link" href="#game-modes">Explore game modes <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-note"><span class="note-icon" aria-hidden="true">✦</span> Made for the room, not just the screen.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-art" aria-label="Illustration of the Kaboot TV and player phone interfaces">
        <div class="art-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="floating-label label-top" aria-hidden="true"><span class="live-dot"></span> GAME ON</div>
        <div class="tv-frame" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="tv-top"><span><b>K</b> kaboot.</span><span>ROUND 04 <i></i> LIVE</span></div>
          <div class="tv-content">
            <div class="tv-clue">
              <span class="mini-eyebrow">THE BIG SCREEN</span>
              <div class="clue-symbol">✦</div>
              <strong>It's anyone's game.</strong>
              <span class="clue-subtitle">The next clue is on screen.</span>
              <div class="timer-line"><span></span></div>
              <div class="timer-caption"><span>TIME REMAINING</span><span>00:18</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="tv-sidebar">
              <div class="screen-points"><span>TIMED POINTS</span><strong>400 <small>pts</small></strong></div>
              <span class="sidebar-title">LEADERBOARD</span>
              <div class="score-row"><b>1</b><span class="avatar avatar-pink">M</span><span>Mia</span><strong>1,450</strong></div>
              <div class="score-row"><b>2</b><span class="avatar avatar-gold">J</span><span>Jon</span><strong>1,200</strong></div>
              <div class="score-row"><b>3</b><span class="avatar avatar-green">A</span><span>Alex</span><strong>950</strong></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tv-bottom"><span>THE ROOM IS PLAYING</span><span>● ● ● &nbsp; 08 PLAYERS</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="phone-frame" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="phone-notch"></div>
          <div class="phone-heading"><span>K</span> kaboot.</div>
          <div class="phone-user"><span class="avatar avatar-pink">M</span><span>HEY, MIA!<strong>1,450 <small>pts</small></strong></span></div>
          <div class="phone-prompt">KNOW IT?</div>
          <div class="buzz-button">BUZZ!</div>
          <div class="phone-footer">YOUR MOMENT TO PLAY</div>
        </div>
        <div class="floating-label label-bottom" aria-hidden="true"><span>✦</span> YOUR PHONE. YOUR BUZZER.</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="intro-strip" aria-label="Kaboot at a glance">
      <div class="container strip-inner">
        <span><b>01</b> One host</span>
        <span><b>02</b> One big screen</span>
        <span><b>03</b> Everyone plays</span>
        <span class="strip-end">A LITTLE COMPETITION GOES A LONG WAY <span aria-hidden="true">✳</span></span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section container" id="how-it-works">
      <div class="section-heading split-heading">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">THE EXPERIENCE</p><h2>One room.<br><span>Three perspectives.</span></h2></div>
        <p>Designed for real people in the same room: a host running the show, a shared screen bringing the drama, and a phone in every player's hand.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="role-grid" id="the-setup">
        <article class="role-card">
          <div class="card-top"><span class="icon-box icon-gold" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><span class="card-number">01 / HOST</span></div>
          <h3>You're in control.</h3>
          <p>Run the quiz from your laptop. Start questions, judge answers, manage scores and keep the game moving.</p>
          <span class="card-tag">THE HOST CONSOLE <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
        </article>
        <article class="role-card">
          <div class="card-top"><span class="icon-box icon-pink" aria-hidden="true">▣</span><span class="card-number">02 / DISPLAY</span></div>
          <h3>All eyes up.</h3>
          <p>Put the action on a TV: clues, the countdown, points and a live leaderboard everyone can follow.</p>
          <span class="card-tag">THE BIG SCREEN <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
        </article>
        <article class="role-card">
          <div class="card-top"><span class="icon-box icon-mint" aria-hidden="true">◉</span><span class="card-number">03 / PLAYERS</span></div>
          <h3>Everyone's in.</h3>
          <p>Players join on their phones, pick a name and avatar, then buzz or submit answers as the game unfolds.</p>
          <span class="card-tag">THE PLAYER VIEW <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
        </article>
      </div>
      <p class="setup-note"><span aria-hidden="true">✦</span> Hosted locally: connect the host, display and player phones to the same network.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="modes-section" id="game-modes">
      <div class="container section">
        <div class="section-heading split-heading">
          <div><p class="eyebrow">PICK YOUR MOMENT</p><h2>Three ways<br><span>to play.</span></h2></div>
          <p>Mix question modes throughout your quiz. Reward quick thinking, give everyone a chance to answer, or do both.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mode-grid">
          <article class="mode-card">
            <div class="mode-number">01 <span>THE RACE</span></div>
            <div class="mode-icon mode-buzz" aria-hidden="true">↯</div>
            <h3>Buzzer</h3>
            <p>Know the answer? Buzz in first and answer aloud. The host makes the call; a wrong answer costs points and gives others a chance.</p>
            <span class="mode-pill">FAST THINKING</span>
          </article>
          <article class="mode-card">
            <div class="mode-number">02 <span>EVERYONE ANSWERS</span></div>
            <div class="mode-icon mode-type" aria-hidden="true">Aa</div>
            <h3>Typed</h3>
            <p>Everyone submits a private answer on their phone. The host reviews the answers and awards fixed points for correct responses.</p>
            <span class="mode-pill">EVERYONE PLAYS</span>
          </article>
          <article class="mode-card featured-mode">
            <div class="mode-number">03 <span>THE BEST OF BOTH</span></div>
            <div class="mode-icon mode-both" aria-hidden="true">✦</div>
            <h3>Type + buzz</h3>
            <p>Submit a typed answer to unlock your buzzer early, or wait for the typing window to end. Players can earn both typed and buzzer points.</p>
            <span class="mode-pill">DOUBLE OPPORTUNITY</span>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="media-line"><span>ANY MODE, MORE WAYS TO CLUE</span><div><span>TEXT</span><span>IMAGE</span><span>AUDIO</span><span>VIDEO</span></div></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section container scoring-section" id="scoring">
      <div class="scoring-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">THE POINT OF IT ALL</p>
        <h2>Every second.<br><span>Every decision.</span></h2>
        <p>Set the stakes for each question. Buzzer points can stay fixed or step down over time, turning a quick answer into a strategic choice.</p>
        <div class="scoring-features">
          <div><span aria-hidden="true">↘</span><p><strong>Set the pace</strong>Choose a starting value, delay, reduction steps and minimum for timed buzzer points.</p></div>
          <div><span aria-hidden="true">✳</span><p><strong>Make it count</strong>The buzzer value locks at the first buzz. A correct answer wins it; a wrong answer loses half, rounded up.</p></div>
          <div><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><p><strong>Watch the standings shift</strong>Scores update as the host judges answers, keeping the leaderboard in play.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="points-panel">
        <div class="panel-top"><span><span class="live-dot"></span> TIMED POINTS</span><span>EXAMPLE SETTINGS</span></div>
        <p class="points-label">THE VALUE OF A QUICK ANSWER</p>
        <div class="points-value">500 <span>pts</span></div>
        <p class="points-description">Start strong. As time passes, the available buzzer points decrease in steps.</p>
        <div class="steps" aria-label="Example point values: 500, 400, 300, 200, 100">
          <div><span>500</span><i style="--height: 100%"></i></div>
          <div><span>400</span><i style="--height: 80%"></i></div>
          <div><span>300</span><i style="--height: 60%"></i></div>
          <div><span>200</span><i style="--height: 40%"></i></div>
          <div><span>100</span><i style="--height: 20%"></i></div>
        </div>
        <div class="panel-bottom"><span>STARTING VALUE</span><span>MINIMUM VALUE</span></div>
        <div class="panel-note"><span aria-hidden="true">✦</span> Typed answers use fixed points. Timed scoring applies to the buzzer portion.</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="closing container">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">READY FOR QUIZ NIGHT?</p><h2>Bring your people.<br><span>Bring your game.</span></h2><p>One room, a little friendly competition, and plenty of moments worth celebrating.</p></div>
      <a class="button button-primary" href="#top">Back to the top <span aria-hidden="true">↑</span></a>
      <div class="closing-star" aria-hidden="true">✳</div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <footer class="container footer"><a class="brand" href="#top"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">K</span><span>kaboot<span class="brand-dot">.</span></span></a><span>BUZZ IN. GET BOOTED.</span><span>MADE FOR QUIZ NIGHT <span aria-hidden="true">✦</span></span></footer>
</body>
</html>
